id: pm-wn1jy1
title: "GH-946: context signal-store staleness warning has no executable remediation contract"
description: "GitHub issue https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/946 reports that pm context emits context_signal_store_stale as a bare warning with no meaning, remediation map, or executable recovery. Define one SDK-owned warning/remediation contract shared by context, CLI, MCP, help, and contracts, and prove the suggested recovery clears the stale condition without requiring an optional command that is not installed."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[5]: agent-ux,"area:context",context-management,remediation,sdk
