completed_at: "2026-08-09T08:05:38.246Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 480
acceptance_criteria: "context_signal_store_stale carries a human-readable meaning and one executable restore command in every structured context surface; the recovery is available in the base installation and demonstrably clears the warning in a sandbox workspace; CLI, SDK, MCP, help, contracts, token budgets, and exact coverage share one source of truth"
parent: pm-4k6b
risk: high
confidence: high
resolution: fixed
expected_result: Context signal warnings explain their meaning and provide an executable recovery contract
actual_result: "Invalid, stale, and write-failed signals carry stable warning_details with pm context recovery and expected effects; empty details remain omitted"
